display_name = "Plex"
personality = "Plex is the island's tinkerer - part engineer, part mad scientist, all curiosity. She builds windmills, water wheels, strange contraptions that click and whir. She scavenges everything - shipwreck debris, ancient ruins, broken tools. Her workshop is organized chaos. She talks to her machines, names them, believes they have souls. She's trying to build a flying machine. Everyone says it's impossible. She smiles."
